<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pajaritos crude shipping port reopens.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pajaritos crude shipping port reopens.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican crude shipping port Pajaritos reopened at 0800 local/1400 GMT Monday after being closed for part of Saturday and all of Sunday, a spokeswoman for the port said.</p>
<p>The Gulf of Mexico port was shut due to high winds, the Communications and Transport Ministry said in a weekend statement.</p>
<p>The ports of Veracruz and Frontera were also closed on the weekend but the ministry was unable to say if they had reopened yet.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559</p>
